# Fledge local environment (DO NOT COMMIT real secrets)
# Copy to `.env` and fill values. `.env` is gitignored.
#
# Never put OpenAI / Anthropic / Gemini / GitHub / CurseForge / Discord bot tokens
# (or any personal API keys) into source files, commits, Issues, or PRs.
#
# Optional overrides, for example:
# FLEDGE_DISCORD_CLIENT_ID=
